emucap: bound PI and RDRAM register accesses to the modelled register files.

pi_reg() and rdram_reg() index the register arrays without a bound. libdragon's entropy pool
reads 0x04600034 (one past PI_BSD_DOM2_RLS) and the RDRAM row register at 0x03F00200, which
returned the bytes after the arrays: host pointers that change with ASLR, so every cold boot
seeded a different random state. Out-of-range reads return zero and writes are ignored.

